# Design system (required)

Every UI, form, email, and visual change must reuse this system. Do not invent parallel chrome.

## Sources of truth
- Tokens: `src/styles/tokens.css` + `src/lib/design-tokens.ts` (keep in sync; emails use the TS file)
- Field chrome: `src/lib/field-styles.ts` — never copy `h-10 w-full rounded-xl border border-input…`
- Atoms: `src/components/ui` (`Input`, `Textarea`, `NativeSelect`, `Button`, `Label`, `Switch`)
- Molecules: `Field`, `FieldLabel`, `FieldHint`, `FieldError`, `FieldSuccess`, `FieldGrid`, `FieldGroup`, `FormStack`, `FieldControl`
- List filters: `listFilterControlClassName` from `src/components/layout/list-layout.tsx`

## Color and type
- Prefer semantic utilities: `bg-action`, `text-brand`, `bg-canvas`, `bg-surface`, `text-muted-foreground`
- Do not hardcode hex or government IRCC/MIFI red/blue motifs
- Fonts: Plus Jakarta Sans (headings), Inter (body); radius 12px; elevation `--shadow-elevated`

## Forms (mandatory)
- Wrap labeled controls in `Field` + `FieldLabel`. Use `FieldHint` / `FieldError` / `FieldSuccess` instead of ad-hoc `<p className="text-xs text-muted-foreground">`
- Use `NativeSelect` — never a raw product `<select>`
- Use `FormStack` for form roots; `FieldGrid` for 2–3 column rows
- Densities: `default` (CRM/auth/settings/public), `compact` (address/phone/passport/IMM), `dense` (table filters)
- Composites (`address`, `phone_contact`, `passport`): existing `FieldGroup` organisms, compact fields
- Switch rows may keep `Label` beside `Switch`. Checkboxes in a group stay native `<label>` + input
- `FieldLabel required` for the asterisk — do not concatenate `" *"`

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
<div className="space-y-2">
  <Label>Title</Label>
  <select className="h-10 w-full rounded-xl border border-input …" />
</div>

// ✅ GOOD
<Field>
  <FieldLabel htmlFor="title" required>Title</FieldLabel>
  <Input id="title" />
</Field>
<Field>
  <FieldLabel htmlFor="status">Status</FieldLabel>
  <NativeSelect id="status">…</NativeSelect>
</Field>
```

## Extending the system
- New visual need → add a token or atom first, then use it. Do not one-off a second input/select style
- New field type → update `fieldTypes` / `fieldTypeMeta` and `field-styles.ts`
- New list filter → `listFilterControlClassName` + `density="dense"` in tables, `default` on mobile
- Restore point: git tag `pre-atomic-design-system` (`bdf59a3`)
